# Excalidraw's bundled code can embed tweets and Reddit posts, so it names their
# widget scripts. The drawing page never loads them: its Content-Security-Policy
# allows no network at all (notterizmus/drawing_web/index.html), and the app's web
# view loads nothing but its own files.
